<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to provide statutory recognition of the
Australian Catholic University and to facilitate its operation within New
South Wales.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f6f88148-277f-4b15-bde8-4082fa857630"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_5de440de-582f-4281-9496-197da0fafdb4"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1990-110" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Australian Catholic University Act
1990</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f9cddd4e-1295-4153-b179-3eeae9fe3d41"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_d6851613-3bac-409d-8118-7545a583d2d1"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on 1 January
1991.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cab0f3ea-ec5f-4204-8a04-dffba301b64b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_53555f2a-4b72-4800-abe5-9a95e2dc85ea"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_6c80b4f5-2314-4ac0-8435-17e97602bb24"
id="def.AustralianCatholicUniversity"><b><i>Australian Catholic
University</i></b></defterm> or <defterm type="definition"
guid="_81455e37-c705-4de2-ad4f-31c8d79267a2"
id="def.University"><b><i>University</i></b></defterm> means the company
incorporated under the <legref jurisd="VIC" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Companies (Victoria) Code</i></name></legref> under the name
of the Australian Catholic University Limited or under that name as changed
from time to time.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_6e550c57-746d-4888-a32d-a229f30a1bf1"
id="def.constituentdocuments"><b><i>constituent documents</i></b></defterm>,
in relation to the University, means the memorandum and articles of
association of the company referred to in the definition of <defterm
type="definition" guid="_37723d1a-da4f-4666-9783-0cd1aa053e4a"
id="def.AustralianCatholicUniversity-oc.2"><b><i>Australian Catholic
University</i></b></defterm>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_4cfc7935-6056-40b0-8829-a71813297703"
id="def.Senate"><b><i>Senate</i></b></defterm> means the Senate of the
University as constituted from time to time in accordance with the constituent
documents of the University.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_18bbf645-b187-4b9b-955b-b267e7efb254"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_79280e89-7e83-40bf-a975-ee7f377428cb"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Objects</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The objects of this Act are to provide statutory
recognition of the Australian Catholic University as a university and to
facilitate its operation within New South Wales.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d012b664-eeba-46fa-a13f-937d5c21fae1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_68216765-9953-4146-87c1-aa03fe71b6a4"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Application of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1fc1af12-d5bd-41ce-8575-735923448740"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act applies to and in respect of the
University to the full extent to which the law of New South Wales is so
applicable.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_df34380b-8a18-4556-a70f-8a9cbf4075e2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act limits the application to or
in respect of the University of any other law to the full extent to which that
law is so applicable.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_79adaefd-e3dd-4971-a83b-d5a751e1e461"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_db8fd5e9-3edf-4fc0-a5ab-13eb8047334e"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Official status as a university</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The University:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f7cf0578-395a-493c-8660-db4b8a2bf3d2" id="sec.6-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is an official university for the purposes of
section 4 of the <legref refid="act-1988-012" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Higher Education Act
1988</i></name></legref>, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_cf54a2fd-b234-4c6a-9674-bca52ed63e0d" id="sec.6-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is authorised to be called a university,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_24a9e816-c4dd-4515-b5c2-957f63c761bf" id="sec.6-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is authorised to confer
degrees.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9acdc9f1-0913-47a7-b055-d9edf532573e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_89d39fc4-59ef-420a-b264-4fa2918bfd26"
id="sec.7-he"><b>No religious test or political
discrimination</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person is not, because of his or her religious
or political affiliations, views or beliefs, to be denied admission as a
student of the University or to be taken to be ineligible to graduate from or
to enjoy any benefit, advantage or privilege of the
University.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b404db3d-afc2-4a38-b35f-ec3c684f52d6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_58d0f7b9-726b-4202-833d-43be86f7b6c3"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Investment of University funds</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Schedule 1 has effect in relation to the
investment of funds belonging to or vested in the
University.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_322a1b87-02c1-45c0-90ce-b8f8e2835bc3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_13068f3a-987b-4410-a8be-603113e3e323"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Rule of law as to remoteness of vesting not to apply to gifts
etc</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The rule of law against remoteness of vesting
does not apply to or in respect of any gift, bequest or devise accepted by the
University.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7947f4bd-76c1-4717-92ed-35022b47e452"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_e4b9193a-1c34-4d56-94a7-844ef02365e6"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Independence of the University</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">It is declared that, subject to this Act, the
Senate alone is responsible for and has authority over the provision of
education within the University and is not subject, in that respect, to the
direction of any person.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_48114073-9fdd-40a7-bf9c-436a97da165b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_85ac77c0-06f2-41a5-82f7-b8b1cb92a6f8"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Liability of the State</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Neither the State nor any authority of the State
is liable to any action, liability, claim or demand arising from or in
connection with the enactment or operation of this Act or anything done or
omitted by or in connection with the University.</txt></block></level>
</content>


<content type="schedules">

<level type="schedule" id="sch.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="type" value="schedule"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_36505ecb-1af4-44a0-b10d-175c49e57997"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Schedule 1</b></no><heading
guid="_cb46a93d-f97b-46a2-abba-aeb901aab0d5" id="sch.1-he"><b>Investment of
University funds</b></heading></head>
<block align="right" type="sourceref"><txt>(Section 8)</txt></block>

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_19784ec5-9512-407b-9a9e-f6750c72f4ff"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_a0fa9a9f-5757-4acf-aefd-f8fdee4526bd"
id="sch.1-sec.1-he"><b>Definition of funds</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of this Schedule, the funds of
the University include funds under the control of the University and real
property, securities or other property comprising an
investment.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c0130e88-6f5b-48ae-91a9-7967caf30314"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_1a0c280b-333d-4905-9d8a-991182001b69"
id="sch.1-sec.2-he"><b>Investment common funds</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ad799b22-fd12-4563-8dda-f53010a8fe83"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The University may establish one or more
investment common funds.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_32e21685-5368-4b28-a2f4-fe4c5abd4c48"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The University may from time to time, without
liability for breach of trust, bring into or withdraw from any such investment
common fund the whole or any part of any trust funds or other funds of the
University.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_25726615-d43c-447f-aab7-974ca9df6088"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to subclause (4), the University must
periodically distribute the income of each investment common fund among the
funds participating in the common fund, having regard to the extent of the
participation of each fund in the common fund during the relevant accounting
period.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_86df294a-7706-4412-880d-b6fcf32b0aad"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The University may, if it considers it expedient
to do so, from time to time add some portion of the income of an investment
common fund to the capital of the common fund or use some portion of the
income to establish or augment a fund or funds as a provision against capital
depreciation or reduction of income.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1389720d-d71f-44ba-a26b-ea7fc388de11"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If an investment is brought into an investment
common fund:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_104ac7b5-c44b-4749-81bb-86869167db94" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the University is to be regarded as holding that
investment on behalf of and for the benefit of the common fund instead of the
participating trust fund or other fund, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_939f1028-5f09-4e38-8290-3109e5da572d" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">that participating fund is to be regarded as
having contributed to the common fund an amount of money equivalent to the
value attributed to the investment by the University at the time it is brought
into the common fund, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3a9287c3-fa91-45d0-a951-fbc75a799ffb" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.5-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">on the withdrawal of that participating fund from
the common fund, the amount of money to be withdrawn is to be the amount
equivalent to the value attributed by the University to the equity in the
common fund of that participating fund at the time of
withdrawal.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2762bff1-8ddf-476a-8db6-5b5ab39b0f39"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The inclusion in an investment common fund of
trust funds does not affect any trust to which those trust funds (or money
attributed to them) are subject.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ed5c7abc-82ad-4506-93be-1a4a6beab21b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(7)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">On the withdrawal of trust funds from an
investment common fund, the funds (or money attributed to them) continue to be
subject to the trust.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cbe8a421-e038-4634-9561-8cee77cd4ddc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_bf758563-38a8-4eab-a550-7ff5afe1828f"
id="sch.1-sec.3-he"><b>Terms of trust to prevail</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In respect of the trust funds of the
University:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ac92039c-ff23-4354-8826-6bacda47e9b6" id="sch.1-sec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the power of the University to bring the trust
funds into an investment common fund, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
